{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Sorry to keep you waiting, everyone. Mari, here's my 10k.": "",
  "(All right, I guess I'll see what I can glean from her apparel and body language.)": "",
  "Well, we're about to get the scoop on Mari. I thought if you were free, you might be interested.": "",
  "Maybe, but tonight's the night, buddy. Especially with you around.": "",
  "Some of the regulars are playing a little betting game to see if they can guess what she does for a living.": "",
  "Thing is, nobody's got it right yet, so I figure that's where you come in, <font_kind=yakuza_italic>detective</font_kind>.": "",
  "Ah, don't be like that. There's money on the table if you win, you know.": "",
  "See you soon, buddy.": "",
  "Soo... a nurse, right?": "",
  "You think a nurse could go out drinking by herself every night? They're busy! And tired.": "",
  "Maybe you're in the press, then?": "",
  "Hah, I doubt journalists are so bored they go out drinking every night, either.": "",
  "Oh, a new challenger approaches, and this one's a detective. Watch out, Mari.": "",
  "Come for some sport, Tak?": "",
  "You want in? It's a 10,000 yen ante. Whoever guesses Mari's occupation takes the pot.": "",
  "Don't be a buzzkill, Tak. I think you might actually have a shot.": "",
  "So, how about I make it more interesting for you? I'll bet 50,000... that nobody can guess.": "",
  "Th-That's a lot! So the winner gets 90,000 yen!?": "",
  "Wow, more interesting is right.": "",
  "How about it, Tak? There's quite a fortune on the line if you can guess it.": "",
  "Ah, a vote of no confidence, then? How disappointing.": "",
  "Then... Do you want in or not?": "",
  "Come on, you're short?": "",
  "What a buzzkill.": "",
  "Let's see those detective skills at work, Tak.": "",
  "Haha... You're welcome to \"observe.\" Take all the time you need.": "",
  "(That necklace has some expensive stones... Certainly didn't come from the discount aisle.)": "",
  "(If she bought it herself, she's doing just fine on her own. But it could also have been a gift from a guy...)": "",
  "(Then again, if she's here every night, chances are low that she's serious with anyone right now.)": "",
  "(That material isn't cheap, and the design is classy, too. Probably a luxury brand?)": "",
  "(No way she goes through the hassle of dressing up to come drinking, but no way she wears that to work, either...)": "",
  "(Could she be a freelancer of some sort?)": "",
  "(No ring on the finger. Not even a callus where one would have been. I've gotta assume she's not married.)": "",
  "(Nice. That's useful info.)": "",
  "(Her nails are nicely manicured...)": "",
  "(That probably means having long nails and nail polish don't interfere with her job.)": "",
  "(The color is a bold choice.)": "",
  "(It's safe to assume wherever she works isn't super conservative.)": "",
  "Your hair is dyed and your nails are done, so you clearly don't have a job that would impose rules on you.": "",
  "No ring means no husband. You're dressed to the nines, down to the accessories. Clearly you have money.": "",
  "And... the fact that you're here every night means you aren't working very demanding hours.": "",
  "Impressive! I know who to call if I ever need a detective.": "",
  "So, I'm right so far?": "",
  "Ha, could be. It wouldn't be fair if I told you, would it?": "",
  "Oh, I can confirm that she isn't short on money.": "",
  "I couldn't help but notice earlier... You paid your tab with a black card, right?": "",
  "Oh, now that I think about it...": "",
  "Really? Can't you only get one of those if you're filthy rich?": "",
  "Heyyy, how rich are we talking here!?": "",
  "(She clearly has both money and the luxury of time...)": "",
  "(Then Mari's occupation must be...)": "",
  "If you're spending money however you want, I'm going to say you're romantically involved with a CEO.": "",
  "And the reason you're here alone... is because he doesn't make time for you.": "",
  "Oh really? That one certainly came out of nowhere...": "",
  "Makes sense to me. So you're betting on her being a CEO's lover, Tak?": "",
  "Are you an author, perhaps? I'd guess you come to the bar to hear stories that make for great research.": "",
  "Interesting. No one's every guessed that before. Final answer?": "",
  "Yeah, I'll go with it.": "",
  "If you're that rich, I can only assume you're a doctor.": "",
  "But aren't doctors kind of busy? And I don't think I'd see a doctor with nails like these...": "",
  "Not if you own your practice yourself. And who's to say when you put on that nail polish?": "",
  "Anyone else? Care to venture a guess?": "",
  "Hmm. I'm gonna go with accountant. Yep.": "",
  "I'll say she's a principal of a private school.": "",
  "All good guesses. I'll take a stab at her being in stocks.": "",
  "Real estate management.": "",
  "So, time to call the bet. What's the answer, Mari?": "",
  "...Bzzzt. You're all wrong.": "",
  "I win. Looks like I'll be taking the pot.": "",
  "Ugh. Damn it...": "",
  "I should be off, though. I do have <font_kind=yakuza_italic>work</font_kind> to do, you know.": "",
  "Work? At this time of night?": "",
  "Yep. Not that I have to go if I don't feel like it.": "",
  "Well, that went poorly.": "",
  "Ugh. I doubt we were even close.": "",
  "Yup. And we're no closer now than when we started.": "",
  "Say, Tak. Don't detectives also tail people for a living?": "",
  "Huh? Wait, you don't mean...": "",
  "Oh, but I do! Why don't you see where she goes? Discreetly, of course.": "",
  "S-Seriously?": "",
  "Oh, that's good! At this point, I'd be willing to pay for the truth.": "",
  "...Fine. If it's a job, I'll take it.": "",
  "(Hm. There she is. Let's see where she goes.)": "",
  "Hey! That's...": "",
  "Mari... No way...": "",
  "I guess you'd make pretty good money at a high-end soapland...": "",
  "(Damn, she's onto me. Just who are you, Mari?)": "",
  "(But I may have a chance if she's going to work now... I just have to make sure she doesn't catch me.)": "",
  "(Mari would recognize me in a heartbeat, of course. Maybe I should...)": "",
  "(There we go. This should make it harder for her to recognize me.)": "",
  "Wait, don't tell me...": "",
  "Is that you, Tak? Try as you might, you can't hide it. Besides, I had a hunch you might follow me.": "",
  "...! But how?": "",
  "I guess I knew you'd be the type to call my bluff.": "",
  "Your bluff?": "",
  "Don't you get it? Welcome to what I do for a living.": "",
  "You're... a gambler?": "",
  "That's right. And a gambler only works when she's feeling lucky.": "",
  "That's my little secret.": "",
  "I see... Makes sense why the idea of a betting pool excited you, too.": "",
  "I only did it for fun at first, you know. But then I kept winning.": "",
  "I guess I have a talent for it.": "",
  "And when I'd made enough money, I left office work behind.": "",
  "And now you have a black card. Pretty impressive.": "",
  "But the others are chomping at the bit to find out, I assume? Tell you what, if I pay you, will you keep it a secret?": "",
  "Can't exactly have rumors spreading that I make my fortunes in illegal casinos, can I?": "",
  "Yeah, I wouldn't want that getting out either. I'll tell them I lost you in a crowd.": "",
  "But I must say, you're a really good detective. Your logic was on point.": "",
  "What do you say? Want to see how you fare in my line of work? You might do better than you'd think.": "",
  "N-Nah. I could also do worse than you'd think.": "",
  "(I've gotta figure out how to tail Mari without being caught...)": "",
  "(Nah, this won't work. Isn't there something I could use to hide my face?)": "",
  "(Maybe... She's already married?)": "",
  "(Is there anything I can find on her that would tell me more about her marriage history?)": "",
  "(She went downstairs....)": "",
  "Those eyes... They're deeper than the Kamurocho sewers, yet brighter than a trash can bonfire... Just who are you, anyway?": "",
  "...I'm Yagami. Can I help you with something?": "",
  "Depends. Let me introduce myself first. I'm Morio Onodera.": "",
  "I tell ya buddy, when you've spent as much time below the pipes as me, you stumble across some strange shit.": "",
  "Dealing in such odds and ends is what I do for a living.": "",
  "Hmm. Got anything worth looking at?": "",
  "How 'bout a talisman that boosts your luck at the casino? And that's just for starters.": "",
  "(Why would anyone even make something like that? Sounds pretty sketchy...)": "",
  "...I see. What's your asking price?": "",
  "Pshaw, I ain't after any money.": "",
  "What do you mean? You have to make a living somehow.": "",
  "That's where you're wrong. I chose this lifestyle 'cause I don't wanna be tied down to the filth of the world above.": "",
  "They call it the almighty coin, but I say it's the root of all evil. What I value now is experience.": "",
  "Go on...": "",
  "So I have people talk about their life experiences and give them something based on what they say.": "",
  "Your eyes tell me you've gone through quite a lot in your young life. I bet you got some amazing stories to tell.": "",
  "How about it? Feel like having a sit-down?": "",
  "Yeah, I could do that.": "",
  "Perfect. This is what I have in stock right now.": "",
  "On a tight schedule, huh? It's fine, you can always come back some other time.": "",
  "I knew you were one of a kind! What an incredible story... Can't wait to hear more.": "",
  "Hey, Yagami-san. There anything you want today?": "",
  "Remember, I trade in life experiences, not coins. So give me a good story.": "",
  "Yagami-san, you are one unusual guy. Honestly, I don't think I've ever met another fella with such an interesting background.": "",
  "Yeah. So I'm throwin' in a little bonus this time.": "",
  "I'm sure I'll scrounge up something new sooner or later, so hopefully I'll have something for you next time!": "",
  "Sounds good to me.": "",
  "'Preciate it! Come back again soon!": "",
  "Yagami-san, need something?": "",
  "Saori-san, got any work for me?": "",
  "Here's what we have right now.": "",
  "Do your best out there.": "",
  "No, it's fine. I'll come back later.": "",
  "Good work out there.": "",
  "Saori-san, wanna grab some fresh air with me?": "",
  "I suppose I can make the time. Give me just a second.": "",
  "I'm ready. Let's go.": "",
  "What is it, Yagami-san?": "",
  "You wanna start heading back?": "",
  "Okay. It's about that time.": "",
  "That was a nice change of pace. It's nice to get out of the office now and then.": "",
  "I'm glad. I'll walk you back to the office.": "",
  "I see... Okay.": "",
  "Let's do it again sometime, yeah?": "",
  "Sure. I don't usually walk that much, so I'm tired.": "",
  "Sounds like you need to hit the gym. Haha. I'll walk you back to the office.": "",
  "How about you invite Mafuyu out sometime?": "",
  "Huh? Mafuyu?": "",
  "Yes. I'm sure she would be thrilled.": "",
  "Ah, yeah. I'll think about it.": "",
  "Well, let's head back to the office.": "",
  "(How are the jobs looking?)": "",
  "(What am I in the mood for?)": "",
  "(I guess I should get some records first.)": "",
  "(Hm? What's that noise?)": "",
  "(An alarm? Where's it coming from?)": "",
  "(What!? That was an explosion!)": "",
  "Ahhh! Run for it!": "",
  "Call the police!": "",
  "R-Run!": "",
  "(Is it terrorists? Some kind of yakuza thing?)": "",
  "That noise again. Another bomb? Where is it coming from!?": "",
  "(Here it is! It really is a bomb...)": "",
  "Waaaaah! Mommy!": "",
  "(How did this kid end up here alone!?)": "",
  "(This is bad. This kid could get...)": "",
  "(What do I do, what do I do, what do I do!?)": "",
  "(No time to think! Shit!)": "",
  "(Only 15 seconds left!!)": "",
  "(Ugh, what the fuck!?)": "",
  "(Shit! No time left! Just gotta do it!)": "",
  "(Ahhhhhhh!!)": "",
  "Did we... survive?": "",
  "Yasu-kun!": "",
  "Mommy!": "",
  "I'm sorry! I'm so sorry!": "",
  "(Oh thank god... I thought we were both goners...)": "",
  "(A phone call? Who would be calling me from a blocked number?)": "",
  "There are bombs in Kamurocho.": "",
  "Excuse me!?": "",
  "I said, I've placed bombs in Kamurocho. Three, in total.": "",
  "The first one exploded, as you saw. The second, you have just disarmed.": "",
  "And that leaves one more.": "",
  "Hold on! Who are you!? And how did you get my number!?": "",
  "Is there really time to be asking questions? You have five minutes before it explodes.": "",
  "Hahaha... If you don't want anyone else to get hurt, I suggest you start looking.": "",
  "Wait, wait! Fine, I'll look for it! But where? You've gotta tell me where!": "",
  "Haha, I suppose it wouldn't be very fair otherwise. I'll give you a hint.": "",
  "You'll find it in the angel of the warrior's maze.": "",
  "Angel of the warrior's maze? What kind of hint is that!?": "",
  "Give it some thought, why don't you? Just remember... the clock's ticking. Five minutes.": "",
  "Things are going to get messy if you fail... Hahahaha.": "",
  "(Angel of the warrior's maze... What the hell!?)": "",
  "(Warrior's maze... Where could that be in Kamurocho?)": "",
  "(Could he mean Little Asia?)": "",
  "(No, that has nothing to do with any of those words...)": "",
  "(Warrior... Fighter... Hero? ...Champion!)": "",
  "(I've got it! It's somewhere in the Champion District!)": "",
  "(Then the next part of the clue is \"angel...\")": "",
  "(Did he mean Shellac, maybe?)": "",
  "(No, that has nothing to do with angels...)": "",
  "(Wait, there <font_kind=yakuza_italic>is</font_kind> an angel in the Champion District! Earth Angel!)": "",
  "(There's no time! I've gotta make it to Earth Angel before that bomb explodes!)": "",
  "(\"Angel of the warrior's maze...\" He had to have meant Earth Angel here in the Champion District, right?)": "",
  "(Now where's the bomb!?)": "",
  "(...Found it!)": "",
  "(Same type of bomb as the other, so I should be able to just pull the wire...)": "",
  "(...Did that work?)": "",
  "(...The countdown stopped!)": "",
  "(Thank god...)": "",
  "Haha... You've done well.": "",
  "Is there a point to this!? What's your game!?": "",
  "Now, let's not get ahead of ourselves. You've been chosen, you see.": "",
  "Chosen? Chosen for what!?": "",
  "Chosen to stop me. You either succeed, or Kamurocho will go up in flames.": "",
  "This isn't over, I'm afraid. Now you just be a good boy and wait... Hahahaha...": "",
  "(He hung up... Who the hell is this guy?)": "",
  "(He said this isn't over though... Shit, what should I do?)": "",
  "(Shit! Time's... up.)": "",
  "We go now to the bombing incident in Kamurocho, where it seems we have an update on the device found at the scene.": "",
  "(They're still looking into that bombing...)": "",
  "According to newly released police reports, the bomb was handcrafted and included a remote controlled timer.": "",
  "The police are continuing to search for any evidence that may lead to the culprit.": "",
  "Citizens are encouraged to call the police should they see any suspicious persons or unattended bags.": "",
  "In other news, the baby panda born last month continues to show healthy growth and...": "",
  "(So basically, they're still hoping to find a lead.)": "",
  "(...A blocked number? Could it be from the bomber? Answering this could lead to trouble, but should I?)": "",
  "Hahaha... The police are useless, wouldn't you agree, Yagami-san?": "",
  "...Are you the bomber? Why do you know my name?": "",
  "I've done my homework. You're a private eye, aren't you?": "",
  "That's none of your business.": "",
  "Hahaha, don't be like that, Yagami. This is fun, isn't it?": "",
  "Shut the hell up.": "",
  "Are you sure it's wise to take this attitude with me? Or would you rather try to find the next bomb without any hints?": "",
  "Hahaha, that certainly changed your tune. I can hear it in your voice. I can feel the tension rising.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "S-Seriously?": "จ-จริงเหรอ?",
  "Wait, don't tell me...": "เดี๋ยวนะ อย่าบอกนะว่า...",
  "Sounds good to me.": "ฟังดูดีสำหรับฉันนะ",
  "Do your best out there.": "สู้ๆนะคะ",
  "Excuse me!?": "อะไรนะ!?",
  "That's none of your business.": "นั่นไม่ใช่เรื่องของคุณ"
 }
}
